# UI Test Scenario Matrix

Source of truth for automating Juno’s end-to-end verification across traditional tests and LLM-driven computer-use runs.

## Legend
- **Tier**: `U` (unit), `I` (integration/service), `E` (UI/macOS automation), `L` (LLM/computer-use agent).
- **Signals**: events (`events::…`), commands, UI states, store keys, or metrics that assert success.
- **Gaps**: instrumentation or harness needs before a scenario can be fully automated.

## Onboarding & First-Run
| Scenario | Trigger | Preconditions | Tier | Signals | Gaps |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Cold launch shows onboarding | Launch empty profile (`bun run tauri dev`) | `AppState` lacks onboarding flag | E, L | Onboarding window visible, `app_state.onboarding_complete=false` | Need deterministic seed data helper to reset onboarding state in automation |
| Resume onboarding after restart | Relaunch during onboarding | Cached `permissions_state` exists | I, E | `get_permissions_state` returns cached state, UI resumes correct step | Add test hook to seed cached state for CI |
| Skip onboarding path | User clicks Skip | Permissions optional | E, L | `stop_permissions_monitoring` invoked, user lands on main UI | Need UI event log to assert skip path fired |

## Permissions Management
| Scenario | Trigger | Preconditions | Tier | Signals | Gaps |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Native status check | `check_permissions_status_native` | macOS permissions available | U, I | `PermissionsState` payload, `events::permissions::CHANGED` | Mockable native checker for CI |
| Accessibility request auto-redirect | Click request, auto redirect enabled | `autoRedirectEnabled=true` | E, L | `request_accessibility_permission_native`, System Settings open event | Need telemetry confirming settings URL open succeeded |
| Screen recording prompt via CG API | Invoke request command | Prior permission denied | I, E | `request_screen_recording_permission_native` returns bool, `timeouts::PERMISSION_CHECK_DELAY_MS` respected | Expose CG API result in telemetry for assertions |
| Microphone diagnostic workflow | User runs “Test microphone” | Voice plugin available | I, E | `test_microphone_functionality` JSON fields | Add fixture to simulate plugin unavailable path |

